---
title: "initialize (LegionFixedPriceSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_validate: validate params
    q_validate --> q_check_timing: params valid
    q_validate --> q_revert_params: params invalid
    q_check_timing --> q_check_addresses: prefundStartTime < prefundEndTime < startTime < endTime < refundEndTime
    q_check_timing --> q_revert_timing: timing sequence invalid
    q_check_addresses --> q_check_fees: bidToken != address(0) AND askToken != address(0) AND projectAdmin != address(0)
    q_check_addresses --> q_revert_addr: invalid addresses
    q_check_fees --> q_set_config: fee percentages valid
    q_check_fees --> q_revert_fees: fee percentages invalid
    q_set_config --> q_set_timing: tokenPrice = _tokenPrice, minimumInvestAmount = _minimumInvestAmount
    q_set_timing --> q_set_addresses: prefundStartTime, prefundEndTime, startTime, endTime, refundEndTime = params
    q_set_addresses --> q_emit: bidToken, askToken, projectAdmin, addressRegistry = params
    q_emit --> [*]: emit Initialized
    q_revert_params --> [*]: revert InvalidParameters
    q_revert_timing --> [*]: revert InvalidTimingSequence
    q_revert_addr --> [*]: revert InvalidAddress
    q_revert_fees --> [*]: revert InvalidFeeConfiguration

    note right of q_set_config
        INV-001: prefundStartTime < prefundEndTime < startTime < endTime < refundEndTime
        INV-002: tokenPrice > 0
        INV-003: minimumInvestAmount > 0
        INV-004: bidToken != askToken
    end note
